WEBVTT

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.350
Did anyone notice
anything else during rehearsal?

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.350
Our entrance and exit
still felt kind of rushed.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.090
We've got a big group, after all.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.260
You're right.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.900
Let's see if we can get
more time to slow it down.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:28.850
Anything else?

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:29.930
Hey there, guys!

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.090
Sis!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.440
Let's make today awesome!

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.680
We look forward to working with you!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:41.290
Sis, just you watch! We're gonna
make up for last time ten times over!

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.240
Only ten times? That's not very much.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.550
Minami, do we
still have time to practice?

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.890
Yes. For our group song?

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:56.690
Yeah.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.990
Wait a minute. I'll join you.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:01.930
I'll ask the stage director
about our entrance and exit first.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.010
Hard to believe, huh?

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:21.830
...Y-Yeah...

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.720
You feeling okay?

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:26.270
Do you want some water?

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:27.040
Wait right there.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.290
It's a little hot.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.960
Should I tell the staff?

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.760
Minami, do you need the help?

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.700
No, I can handle this.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.720
Everyone here?

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.390
Yeah!

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:48.560
First off, let's see that the audience,
the staff, and we all have good, safe fun today

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.230
and make this the
hottest day of the summer!

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:52.510
Yeah!

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:54.870
Now let's huddle up.

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.340
Kaede, it's all yours.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:58.240
Right.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:03.990
Let's huddle and hear a dull "Huh?"!

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.330
Yeah!

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.550
Huh?

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.940
I totally know the feeling.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:13.840
What <i>are</i> you supposed to do
when the leader tells a bad one?

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.750
Oh, was that a joke?

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.290
Oh, wow! It was!

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.010
Cold.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.790
Huh? But it's really hot today.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:24.510
It might be cold because she's here.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.520
Huh?! Is something here?!

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.170
The spoon says yes!

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.570
...U-Um...

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:32.790
Was that a joke?

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:35.790
Yes, I guess.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:38.280
Look what you did.
We need to start the show!

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:40.820
Fine.

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.550
Okay, let's do this again.

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:47.490
346 Productions
Summer Idol Fes starts now.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.910
Let's do our best!

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.110
Yeah!

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:01.470
It's starting!

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.760
...Frogs, frogs...

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:13.100
Chieri, how about a quick run-through?

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.680
We still have some time.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.360
I'll go with her.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.820
I need to do something,
or my nerves will kill me.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:30.380
All right! Welcome again, everyone,
to 346 Productions Summer Idol Fes!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.330
Huh? What?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.830
Someone from the Cinderella Project?

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:36.630
We were practicing
...in the rehearsal room...

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.630
...She said she didn't feel too good...

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.740
It doesn't seem like she has a cold.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.780
Her nerves most likely got to her
and brought on a fever.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.140
Her nerves?

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:51.770
Minami was doing best
to being our leader.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:57.830
...I put unnecessary pressure—

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:58.770
No!

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.720
I stayed up late last night practicing!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.080
I'm sorry.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.450
I'm fine now.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.360
You're still running a fever.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:08.360
Minami.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.010
Nitta.

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:15.330
I cannot allow you to perform today.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.650
I'm sorry.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:35.470
If Love Laika isn't performing,
then we'll need to adjust the schedule.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.980
Wait!

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:39.550
It's my fault I can't perform!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.860
...But Anya...

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.630
Anya can still go on!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.030
...She...

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.720
...She worked so hard...

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:54.890
...Minami...

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.460
Cinderella Project

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.460
Changing Room

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.460
A stand-in? For Minamin?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.520
...I know part of the dance, but...

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:05.130
We don't have the time to practice.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.590
Performing without practice?

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:11.470
At a show this big?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:16.870
...Um...

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.230
Kanzaki?

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:24.970
B-Beyond the second form
lies but mystery.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.570
...Um...

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:31.700
...During training, the three of us...

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.630
...For special training...

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:35.920
...Um...

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:43.300
Doing something with
...together with others...

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.760
was very exciting.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.010
I want to try.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:53.570
Producer.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:55.540
Yes.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:03.060
Ranko, thank you.

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:20.170
It happens to everyone.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:23.460
Working so hard that they
get sick right before a gig.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.210
There really isn't much
you can do about it.

00:06:58.110 --> 00:06:59.160
It's time.

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:01.950
Are you prepared?

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:03.290
Yes.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.550
...Now then—

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:06.670
Gotcha!

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.040
Wh-What?

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.550
Don't forget to smile, Ranko!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.470
You're going on stage!

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.470
Relax! We'll emcee mew guys in perfectly!

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.310
Here! Have some courage!

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:21.950
Have mine too. Here.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.850
No, Chieri! You need yours!

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:30.610
Thank you.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:30.610
Thank you, everyone.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.620
Now then, everyone. It's time.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:36.980
Yeah!

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:04.310
One second.
I'm bringing this part in a bit.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:05.840
Are they ready?

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:06.730
Yes!

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:07.840
Coming!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.610
Wai'!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:12.520
Turn a bi' tha' way.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.820
Okay, there you are.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:16.570
Thank you.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:17.980
Heading your way.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:18.910
You can do it!

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.770
Thank you very much.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.270
No' a' all. I's up to them now.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:28.460
Yes.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:32.050
Today we we're bringing you
a special version!

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:33.550
All right, guys!

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:34.800
Come on down!

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:50.190
Where's Minami?

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.650
Wasn't that girl just on stage?

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:04.410
I've splashed my way through the cold rain of selfishness

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.450
You can do it, Ranko!

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:11.880
It passed, and everything changed, the colors, the smell, and even your smile

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:16.930
But with each passing day, it wells up

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:22.680
"I guess this is good-bye," the last words you said to me

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:22.980
"I guess this is good-bye",
the last words you said to me.

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:31.820
I can still hear them now, and it hurts, because I still love you

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.370
They'll be fine.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.950
Your friends are
doing their best for you.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.060
So don't you worry!

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:38.030
I'll pull back in these lonesome wings of mine

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.040
Okay!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:41.700
But I'll still be dreaming of tomorrow

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:48.870
So I won't look behind me again

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.340
They did it!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.850
See?

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:23.890
Let's go!

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:24.600
Yeah!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.990
Uzhas!

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:27.870
Emergency!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:43.090
All audience members,
please take shelter under a covered area.

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:41.390
A blackout?

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.600
...No way...

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.560
Please close your umbrellas!

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:52.330
If you feel unwell, please request assistance from the concert staff.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:03.240
They said the concert can resume soon.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.510
...Thank goodness...

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:09.000
But... it's still raining.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.490
I-I'm so sorry!

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:15.090
It's fine!

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.250
...I'm so sorry...

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:20.030
I'm no help at all.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:24.670
I couldn't do anything
...when Minami collapsed, either...

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.510
...Chieri...

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:32.070
I need to do what I can do right.

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:33.870
What's wrong with that?

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:38.650
All I can do is to do what I can.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.830
She's right.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.110
Let's focus on what we <i>can</i> do.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:44.400
Yeah.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.120
Yeah! I'll do my best too!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:55.040
What we all have to do now is to do
what we can to the best of our ability!

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.290
Right!

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.300
Yeah! Let's keep running
straight to the finish!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.300
Yeah!

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:08.810
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:12.170
I lost!

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.730
...I lost again...

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:15.440
We have the green light.

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:17.280
Okay!

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:20.630
...Actually...

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.780
...Um... the truth is...

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:26.020
The audience has not yet returned.

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:27.410
You might be surprised.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:34.160
Oh, right. The rain's just letting up.

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:36.910
...But—

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:36.910
...But...

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.290
We've gotta do it.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:40.690
Yeah!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.000
I'm not running out!

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.430
Let's put a smile on
every face here to see us!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.930
Please do your best.

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:52.210
You got it!

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.890
...Shimamu, Shiburin...

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.570
Yeah.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:10.260
Chocolate!

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:14.160
Hi everyone!

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.910
Nice to meet you!

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:18.910
We're New Generations!

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:22.040
Thanks for waiting!

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:26.800
The ground's still wet,
so let's get fired up and dry it out!

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:32.340
Here we go!

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:33.890
...We're New Generations with...

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:36.680
"Brand New! Evo! Revo! Generation!"

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:44.190
Put your hands in the air

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.940
Can you feel the passion in you?

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:52.240
In front of you, behind you, look, it's ready to burst

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:57.710
It wants to jump right out, it just needs a little polish

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:00.710
Now we've got everything we need

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:03.220
And an unstoppable, wonderful feelin'

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:08.840
No one knows what's behind the door in front of us

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:13.680
Come on, you, me, everyone, come on!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:19.660
It's a brand new evolu revolu generation

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:28.490
Let's make it happen, bring in a whole new world

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.060
It's a debut into the future, come on!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.640
Thank you very much!

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:03.900
They were great!

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.780
Those were very nice smiles.

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:08.800
They were.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.150
Great! You were great!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:14.790
Thank you very much!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:15.830
You can do it.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.060
Right.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:20.070
It's our turn, huh?

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.080
They're all yours.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:37.010
happy days, they keep going on

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:41.350
The story of the two of us, you and me

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:43.600
Let's stay together

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.100
Yeah!

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:47.020
Shine, I know, because, I know

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:49.530
The future's gonna be a hundred times happier

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.990
Wave your hands, raise your voice

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:53.200
It'll be fine

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.320
Yeah!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:03.490
Producer!

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.460
Please hear me out.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.110
Thank you very much!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:11.650
We're Asterisk!

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:16.050
You were great out there!

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.900
Th-Thanks?

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.100
Huh?

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.850
Just go down. I'll take over here.

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:27.640
Minami!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:31.080
Are you feeling better?

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.860
Yeah. My fever's gone.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.360
Besides, I couldn't just nap
while everyone was doing their best!

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:41.370
The girls in the Cinderella Project
are like my little sisters.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.250
Hey, hey! Let's huddle!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.780
What's our cheer?

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:52.380
How about "Let's go!"

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.760
Sounds good.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.060
I can't.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:01.220
I ran a fever right before the show.
...I've failed as a leader—

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:03.640
Minamin, we were all waiting for you.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.280
Yeah.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:16.860
Minami.

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.220
Thank you.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:31.570
All right, everyone.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.270
Let's do our very best.

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:36.090
Cinderella Project!

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:37.590
Let's go!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:40.270
Yeah!

00:19:55.780 --> 00:20:01.650
It was so beautiful, so dreamlike, that I nearly cried

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:08.010
That shooting star I saw streaming as the sun set

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:17.340
I just love it when the sky is dyed in twilight

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:22.990
And I love collecting together miracles

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.920
That was awesome, Karen.

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:28.340
Everyone has a story

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:24.680
Yeah.

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:29.330
Know Shibuya Rin from NG?
We went to the same middle school.

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:35.180
Walk your own path; you can start at any time

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.680
Wow.

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:46.530
Look, the sunset's gentle glow is its present to you

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:52.150
It was so beautiful, so dreamlike, that I nearly cried

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:57.740
And there's plenty to look forward to as well

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.040
...It's over already...

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.900
I feel so light.

00:20:57.510 --> 00:20:58.380
Yeah.

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:03.360
Will I be able to reach it if I stretch out my hand?

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:01.480
Excuse me.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:03.710
Oh, Producer!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:09.180
That shooting star I saw streaming as the sun set

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:06.210
Wha's all tha'?

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:08.060
Fan letters.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.180
Addressed to you.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.200
F-Fan letters?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.180
Yes.

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:16.690
And surveys from the audience.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:20.550
I just love our soft, sweet-scented room

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:20.120
Fan letters?

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:26.080
And I love counting up our fun memories

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.100
...It's like we're idols...

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:31.480
Sometimes things happen and you don't know what to do

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.030
We <i>are</i> idols!

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:38.350
Just change the way you look at them; you can always be happy

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.330
...I can't believe it...

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:49.600
See, it isn't sad at all, it's a bright monument of light

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:54.810
It's so beautiful, so dreamlike, that you could nearly cry

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:52.690
...Producer...

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:56.260
Thank you.

00:21:55.570 --> 00:22:00.830
And there'll be plenty more to look forward to

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:02.150
I'm so glad I didn't quit!

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:05.980
Shadows growing longer, the evening wind blowing

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:06.530
I liked that smile.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:13.260
And another shooting star streaming as the sun sets

00:22:11.090 --> 00:22:13.490
Shimamu, read this!

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:22.580
Let's suppose that I had magic powers

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:15.300
What is it, Mio?

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:27.700
I'd take felt wings and glue them to my back

00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:25.550
It's almost unreal.

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:37.010
And fly through the clouds

00:22:28.250 --> 00:22:30.600
What did you think of today?

00:22:34.110 --> 00:22:35.930
It was fun.

00:22:37.890 --> 00:22:38.890
I think.

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:51.170
I saw our audience smile this time!

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:51.910
Yeah!

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:55.400
It's kinda funny.

00:22:56.860 --> 00:23:03.270
I delivered flowers
to a 346 Pro concert before.

00:23:00.970 --> 00:23:06.810
It's so beautiful, so dreamlike, that I nearly cried

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:04.420
Really?

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:07.810
They were for Kaede.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:12.160
Tomorrow, the day after, and the day after that

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:12.680
I never even dreamed that I'd be
standing on the same stage as her.

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:17.930
I'll hold this beautiful bouquet of miracles

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:13.530
Huh?

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:16.790
Was that the winter concert?

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:17.930
Huh? Yeah.

00:23:17.930 --> 00:23:23.480
In both hands as I run down the street as the sun sets

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:20.430
I went to see that!

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:22.520
I was on the staff!

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:28.640
Will I be able to touch it if I stretch out my hand?

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:27.960
Whoa! This is, like,
destiny or something!

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:29.870
If you put it that way,
then I wasn't there!

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:34.340
The gentle flower petals dancing in the wind

00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:30.780
Oh, come on.

00:23:34.200 --> 00:23:36.780
Even if it was just coincidence,

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:38.620
Like all our dreams

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:38.430
it's still kinda awesome!

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:39.160
Yeah!

00:23:39.920 --> 00:23:43.170
We even held a concert with everyone.

00:23:43.170 --> 00:23:44.530
It's like a dream.

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:47.930
But it isn't a dream.

00:23:49.290 --> 00:23:49.670
...Yeah...

00:23:51.190 --> 00:23:52.430
That's right.

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.060
It isn't a dream!
